FitPic
AI Outfit Recommendation System
Technical Documentation


Overview
FitPic is an AI-powered outfit recommendation system that accepts user preferences (style, occasion, skin tone, gender) and returns a ranked list of clothing items sourced from live retail APIs. The system uses a three-tier data pipeline:

•	Real-Time Product Search API
•	ASOS API
•	Local CSV dataset fallback

System Requirements
Requirement	Version
Python	3.9 or higher
pip	Included with Python
Internet connection	Required for live API calls

Dependencies
Package	Purpose
fastapi	Web framework for the REST API server
uvicorn	ASGI server that runs FastAPI
pandas	Data manipulation for the local CSV dataset
requests	HTTP client for external API calls
pydantic	Request/response data validation

Install all dependencies with:

pip install fastapi uvicorn pandas requests pydantic

